id: ops-pack-prepare
title: Keep merge-driver prepare read-only during npm pack and publish
description: "Canonical repair for GitHub issue #148. npm prepare during artifact creation must not register clone-local drivers. Companion owner: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-10T02:41:50.499Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-10T03:23:53.445Z"
author: codex-sol
acceptance_criteria: Real npm pack preserves git config bytes; install and ci still register; broken installations remain fail-closed; revert proof and packed consumer checks.
repro_steps: Run npm pack on a disposable Git consumer using the shipped prepare template and an installed merge-driver entry; compare git config bytes before and after.
expected_result: Artifact creation skips registration before resolution; install and ci continue registering clone-local drivers.
actual_result: All three prepare hooks skip artifact-time registration. Real npm pack preserves config and held lock bytes; install/ci register and broken installation refuses. Three independent hook reverts each fail the regression. Full release gate and packed npm/Bun consumers pass.
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-10T02:42:15.573Z",codex-sol,"Reproduce npm prepare under real pack with git config byte comparison; skip only npm_command pack/publish before package resolution; retain existing install/broken-package behavior. Cover canonical local hook too. Companion: pm-cli-website-session-2026-10-10."
  "2026-10-10T03:02:50.665Z",codex-sol,"Independent implementation reverts: restoring only the template, only the local prepare hook, or only the exported prepare entry each caused test/pack-prepare.test.ts to fail (three separate nonzero runs); repaired bytes restored. Packed npm and native Bun consumers on SDK 2026.10.9 pass scratch creation, validation, strict merge-driver health, npm 11 pack and npm 10.9.4 pack --ignore-scripts with identical Git config bytes. Real install/ci registration remains tested. Initial full-gate fixture exposed inherited npm allow-scripts configuration; fixtures now isolate userconfig and remove only that project-specific parent setting."
  "2026-10-10T03:21:05.726Z",codex-sol,"Final npm run accept:packed exits 0 on separate npm/Node and native Bun consumers: SDK 2026.10.9 create, validation, strict merge-driver health, actual activation and built auditor; npm 11 pack and npm 10.9.4 pack --ignore-scripts preserve Git config bytes. Tarball SHA-256 1d6b39113d187ae64d31d09477fe080f5dfdedc415f72c5fdc879dc5e64d52e6. Real regression also packs successfully with a held config lock and preserves lock contents; install/ci still register and broken installation refuses. Three independent hook reverts each fail that regression. Final release:check passes 496 tests, zero failures, two existing fleet skips. PM-linked pack test passes again; explicit receipts retained because tracking is disabled."
  "2026-10-10T03:23:50.521Z",codex-sol,"Review candidate: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/pull/152, implementation c73e0effbff8c4c493f49e3fa15c5c7208b4f151. Claim released; item remains unclosed pending orchestrator verification. Packed digest, real pack/install behavior and three independent hook revert failures are documented."
